title: Add build-box (remote SSH) support to justfile
updated_at: "2026-08-02T11:30:34Z"
---
Add a configurable build-box mode to the justfile. By default, builds run locally. When configured (via .env or other gitignored config file), builds should:
1. rsync the latest code to the remote build box (x-alpha over SSH)
2. Execute the build remotely
3. Optionally sync artifacts back

The configuration should be gitignored so secrets/hostnames don't leak. Consider a CLAWQ_BUILD_HOST or similar variable.